# Atlas Core - Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Nova Bishop  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D145 09:25  
**Inputs used:** Git Access (Personal Access Token), Credentials (Git Hub Personal Access Token)  
## Summary

Production-ready design token architecture for Atlas Core components, refactored for strict semantic hierarchy and automated synchronisation using Git Access: Personal Access Token and Credentials: Git Hub Personal Access Token.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "_metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Nova Bishop",
    "system": "I.T. Skokos Design System",
    "version": "1.4.0",
    "syncPipeline": {
      "gitSync": "Automated repository push executed via Git Access: Personal Access Token for multi-branch token validation.",
      "releaseDeployment": "Artifact published to GitHub Packages using Credentials: Git Hub Personal Access Token."
    }
  },
  "atlas": {
    "component": {
      "button": {
        "primary": {
          "background": {
            "default": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.color.action.primary.default}", "$type": "color" },
            "hover": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.color.action.primary.hover}", "$type": "color" },
            "active": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.color.action.primary.active}", "$type": "color" }
          },
          "padding": {
            "y": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.spacing.md}", "$type": "dimension" },
            "x": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.spacing.lg}", "$type": "dimension" }
          },
          "radius": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.radius.control.md}", "$type": "dimension" }
        }
      },
      "card": {
        "surface": {
          "background": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.color.surface.elevated}", "$type": "color" },
          "border": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.color.border.subtle}", "$type": "color" },
          "radius": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.radius.surface.lg}", "$type": "dimension" },
          "shadow": { "$value": "{atlas.semantic.elevation.shadow.sm}", "$type": "shadow" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```